  8a3aa0b1|architecture|quality-score-formula|Quality score formula: quality = (0.3 * freshness + 0.3 * accessScore + 0.2 * tagScore + 0.2 * linkScore) * stalenessDecay. freshness: 1/(1+age/30). accessScore: min(accessCount/5, 1). tagScore: min(tags.length/3, 1). linkScore: min(links.length/3, 1). Final range: 0-1.|src/lib/quality.ts|quality;formula;scoring;algorithm|2026-07-28||0|quality-scoring quality-staleness-decay quality-access-tracking|0.97|1|
